          </div></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2"><h2 title="dialed technologies" data-test-partner-name="" class="notranslate truncate text-text typography-h5">
          dialed technologies
        </h2> <!----> <div data-test-partner-description="" class="line-clamp-4 h-[80px] text-text-subtle">
          We are the first software developer-run Attio agency. Both co-founders had careers in software development before entering the Attio world. Through our technical-first approach we've leveraged code to build systems that streamline everything from complex CRM migrations to custom Attio apps. Our Offerings Foundation &amp; Setup • Complete workspace design • Data migrations from other CRMs • Custom data architecture • Team onboarding • Process documentation Custom Development &amp; Integration • Native Attio SDK apps (published marketplace integrations) • Complex API integrations • Bespoke automation workflows • Custom data enrichment • Advanced analytics dashboards De-Duplication • Expert-guided de-duplication platform for Attio combining advanced algorithms with specialist support Why Choose Dialed Best-in-class on one platform. We're all-in on Attio not generalists across multiple CRMs. This exclusive focus means deeper expertise and solutions that leverage Attio's full potential. Technical &amp; foundational. Our implementations start with proper data architecture, ensuring your system scales as your needs evolve. When you're ready for custom apps or integrations, we're already deeply familiar with your setup. Working milestones, not endless projects. We work in 2-week sprints to deliver functional systems you can use immediately. This allows you to test new functionality, provide feedback based on real usage, and stay in control of timeline and budget. Our Process 1. Free 30-min discovery call 2. Technical planning &amp; sprint breakdown 3. Same-day proposal with milestones 4. 2-week sprint execution deliver functional milestone 5. Your team uses it, we schedule next sprint when ready Ideal For • New Attio customers wanting expert setup • Investment firms transitioning from Affinity • Teams needing complex integrations • Organizations requiring custom applications • Businesses valuing iterative development
        </div></div> <div data-test-uiratingsummary="" data-test-partner-reviews="" class="flex gap-x-1"><div data-test-uirating="" class="flex items-center"><div data-test-star="0"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><!----> <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full overflow-hidden w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="text-icon-award h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div data-test-star="1"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><!----> <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full overflow-hidden w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="text-icon-award h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div data-test-star="2"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><!----> <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full overflow-hidden w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="text-icon-award h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 