            Accepting new clients
          </div></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2"><h2 title="Revautex" data-test-partner-name="" class="notranslate truncate text-text typography-h5">
          Revautex
        </h2> <!----> <div data-test-partner-description="" class="line-clamp-4 h-[80px] text-text-subtle">
          I'm Kayla Campos, Founder of Revautex and I design and implement Attio-based GTM systems for teams that have outgrown their CRM or spreadsheets. With a background in business development and sales, I build systems from the operator's perspective: clean data models, automations that actually run, and reporting your team will use. HOW WE CAN HELP: • Attio setup, migration, and optimization - custom objects, attributes, pipelines, lifecycle logic, workflows, AI attributes / features, and reporting completely tailored to your business • Integrations via tools like n8n or Zapier - connecting Attio to any platform with an open API • Training, documentation, and recorded walkthroughs for smooth team adoption WHO WE WORK WITH: Founders, sales teams, and ops teams across SaaS, AI, fintech, agencies, and more, who need a strong GTM foundation without the overhead of a full RevOps hire. HOW TO GET STARTED: 1. Book Intro Call. We'll discuss your business, goals and current setup 2. Strategy &amp; Process Mapping Workshop. For implementation projects, we’ll spend 90 mins with you to deep dive into your business, map out your process in real-time using a flowchart and design a clear Attio structure that makes sense for your business model. 3. Proposal. Sent within 24 hours of the workshop, scoped to what we discussed in the workshop. 4. Project Launch. Because we mapped everything in the workshop, we hit the ground running immediately
