            Accepting new clients
          </div></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2"><h2 title="Craftt " data-test-partner-name="" class="notranslate truncate text-text typography-h5">
          Craftt 
        </h2> <!----> <div data-test-partner-description="" class="line-clamp-4 h-[80px] text-text-subtle">
          Craftt is an AI-native Attio implementation agency. We build Attio workspaces that run with AI agents, automation, and clean data. Go live in 7 business days, or you do not pay. We work best with VCs, agencies, financial services companies, and growth-stage B2B teams. What you get: • Attio live in 7 days. We design your workspace, migrate data, build pipelines around how you sell, wire automations, and train your team. • AI agents inside Attio. Deal review, meeting prep, pipeline hygiene, account research, follow-up drafting, and more. • CRM admin and optimization. Dashboards, reporting, workflow redesign, cleanup, and fractional CRM ops for teams already on Attio. • Automation and workflow design. Sales follow-ups, lifecycle stages, internal handoffs, reporting triggers, and repeatable workflows that reduce manual work. • Integrations and data architecture. Custom objects, API workflows, connected tools, and clean migrations from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Close, Salesforce, Affinity, Sheets, and more. Who we are: Craftt is a focused team of 5 Attio specialists. Attio is our only CRM focus. We help startups and growth-stage teams build a CRM that is fast, structured, and scalable. Who we work with: B2B SaaS, venture capital, insurance, recruiting, consulting, professional services, research, policy, and teams migrating from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity, Close, or Salesforce. Most clients come to us with messy data, unclear pipelines, and manual work. We fix all three in one week. Our missions: 1. Free audit - $0. A written teardown of your Attio workspace in 48 hours, with the three highest-leverage fixes. 2. Tune-up - $1,000. For teams already on Attio but set up wrong. We reconfigure the data model, rebuild workflows, retune up to three Claude agents, document everything, and hand it back. 3. 7-day Sprint - $2,000. Full Attio build: migration, data model, pipelines, automations, integrations, six Claude skills, training, and a 30-day tune-up. Live in 7 business days, or you do not pay. 4. Operating layer - $900/month. Monthly CRM ops: health reports, dashboards, new automations, deduplication, cleanup, and workflow improvements. Runs on your account, with no lock-in. Special offer: Get a free 48-hour Attio audit. Within two business days, we send a written teardown covering what works, where data or pipelines leak revenue, and the three highest-impact fixes to ship this week. Five free audit slots available each week.
