iv data-test-uicardcontent="" class="px-5 py-0 last:pb-5 flex grow flex-col justify-center first:pt-5"><article class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><div data-test-tier="" class="flex h-8 items-center gap-x-5 text-text-subtle"><div data-test-tier-name="" class="grow truncate typography-label-small">
          Core
        </div> <img src="https://content.partnerpage." srcset="https://content.partnerpage. 1x,https://content.partnerpage. 1.5x,https://content.partnerpage. 2x,https://content.partnerpage. 3x,https://content.partnerpage. 4x" alt="Core" loading="lazy" data-test-tier-image="" class="h-8 w-8 object-contain"></div> <div class="flex h-20 w-[200px] max-w-full self-center text-center"><img alt="Carbon Edge" src="https://content.partnerpage." srcset="https://content.partnerpage. 1x,https://content.partnerpage. 1.5x,https://content.partnerpage. 2x,https://content.partnerpage. 3x,https://content.partnerpage. 4x" loading="lazy" data-test-partner-logo="" class="h-full w-full object-contain"></div> <div data-test-availability="" class="flex"><div class="flex items-center gap-x-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full px-[6px] py-px bg-surface-success-subtle-pressed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" data-test-availability-icon-true="" width="16px" height="16px" class="text-text-success"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg> <div data-test-availability-text="" class="truncate text-text">
            Accepting new clients
          </div></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2"><h2 title="Carbon Edge" data-test-partner-name="" class="notranslate truncate text-text typography-h5">
          Carbon Edge
        </h2> <!----> <div data-test-partner-description="" class="line-clamp-4 h-[80px] text-text-subtle">
          Carbon Edge is an Australian technology consultancy helping ambitious businesses transform their operations for an AI-driven world. We have worked with all top-tier CRMs and Attio is the strongest commercial and technical foundation available today. For this reason, Attio sits at the centre of our work as the modern CRM foundation our clients build on, then extend with AI agents, automations, and connected data across their entire stack. We span three modes of engagement: strategic advisory, full delivery, and fractional CTO partnerships. Our work covers CRM and revenue ops, websites and e-commerce, custom applications, workflow automation, and AI integration. Always built as a connected ecosystem rather than a stack of disconnected tools. We work with clients across finance, construction, health, agriculture, e-commerce, professional services, nonprofits and member organisations. Happy to collaborate with in-house teams or other agencies, particularly where modern CRM architecture and AI-powered go-to-market are central to the brief. We offer: • Full Attio implementation, including data model design, pipeline architecture, automations, sequences, and reporting • AI agent and workflow design using Claude, n8n, and Attio's MCP and API • Native and bespoke integrations across HubSpot, Mailchimp, AutoSend, Xero, Shopify, accounting platforms, and custom APIs • Migration from Affinity, Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Microsoft Dynamics, Excel, and CSV-based systems • Sales sequences, call intelligence, and reporting workspace configuration • Ongoing managed support, system enhancements, and roadmap planning • Fractional CTO and digital technology partner engagements for clients who want a senior technology lead without the cost of a full-time hire If you are ready to move towards a connected, AI-ready operating model, we would love to talk. We offer a complementary 45-60 min strategy session.
        </div></div> <div data-test-uiratingsummary="" data-test-partner-reviews="" class="flex gap-x-1"><div data-test-uirating="" class="flex items-center"><div data-test-star="0"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="absolute left-0 top-0 text-icon-disabled h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path></svg> <!----></div></div></div><div data-test-star="1"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="absolute left-0 top-0 text-icon-disabled h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path></svg> <!----></div></div></div><div data-test-star="2"><div data-test-uiratingstar="" class="pointer-events-none h-5 w-5"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" class="absolute left-0 top-0 text-icon-disabled h-5 w-5"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2