925750dd42",name:"Untiered",order:j,image:h,default:a};return {layout:"vendor-directory-full",data:[{}],fetch:{"0":{QueryParam:{PAGE:ba,SEARCH:"search",SORT:"sort",COUNTRY:"country",REGION:"region",CITY:"city",ONLY_EXPERTS_AVAILABLE:"only-experts-available"},partnerProgramUrl:d,vendorName:bb,servicePartnerLabel:ai,resultsText:"38 results",searchQuery:h,suggestionsQuery:d,suggestionsItems:[],suggestionsLoading:b,partnersInfiniteScrollResults:[{id:"fc09363b-29a9-453a-aa27-c051726214e1",name:bc,slug:"novlinir",image:"contact_images\u002Ffc09363b-29a9-453a-aa27-c051726214e1\u002F1df1e318-4e4b-4b6a-82bc-376ab1f175be.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe 1st Attio Expert Partner worldwide.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe help startups, scale-ups, investment firms and structured revenue teams migrate, build and scale their CRM and GTM systems with Attio at the core.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOver the past four years, we’ve delivered 60+ Attio implementations and complex migrations — including transitions from Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity, Zoho, Spreadsheets, Notion and Airtable.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAttio is the CRM foundation. Around it, we design modular GTM stacks that are structured, automated and deeply integrated.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWhat we deliver\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECRM Migrations: \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EClean, controlled transitions to a scalable Attio foundation.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGTM Systems: \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EModular workflows, automation and best-in-class tools (Clay, Lemlist, Customer.io) connected around Attio.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptimization &amp; RevOps: \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EDashboards, automation, reporting and process redesign to improve clarity and performance.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EApp &amp; API Integrations: \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EStructured integrations via API or native Attio App SDK when required.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWe’re one of the most experienced Attio-focused teams worldwide:\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E100% specialized in Attio\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeeply embedded in the product\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn close contact with the Attio team\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhile Attio is our sole CRM focus, we understand every major CRM platform — enabling smooth migrations and thoughtful GTM architecture.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur systems are designed to be powerful and maintainable:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EModular and scalable\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAPI-connected where needed\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo-code when it’s the smartest path\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFounded by Giacomo Caranese, one of the earliest Attio Experts, the team combines GTM strategy, RevOps architecture and hands-on technical execution.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EOur typical missions\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImplement Attio from scratch - \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EFor teams adopting their first structured CRM\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. Data model, pipelines, automation and clean imports.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMigrate from a legacy CRM - \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EFor companies moving from Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity or Zoho\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. End-to-end migration with data restructuring and controlled rollout.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImprove an existing setup - \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EFor teams already using Attio\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. Audit, dashboard redesign and workflow optimization.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your GTM stack - \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EFor sales and growth teams\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. Integration of Clay, Lemlist, Customer.io via API or native SDK.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuild an outbound engine - \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003Cem\u003EFor teams generating qualified leads\u003C\u002Fem\u003E. ICP sourcing, enrichment and automated outreach fully integrated.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003ENext steps\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the link on the left to book your free 30-minute Discovery Call.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWe assess your CRM and GTM setup.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYou receive a clear scope and personalized proposal.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E👉 Book your free 30-minute Discovery Call and let’s design the right Attio system for your growth.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:58,tier:{name:s,imageUrl:bd},countryName:be,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bc,highlightedDescription:"The 1st Attio Expert Partner worldwide.We help startups, scale-ups, investment firms and structured revenue teams migrate, build and scale their CRM and GTM systems with Attio at the core.Over the past four years, we’ve delivered 60+ Attio implementations and complex migrations — including transitions from Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity, Zoho, Spreadsheets, Notion and Airtable.Attio is the CRM foundation. Around it, we design modular GTM stacks that are structured, automated and deeply integrated.What we deliverCRM Migrations: Clean, controlled transitions to a scalable Attio foundation.GTM Systems: Modular workflows, automation and best-in-class tools (Clay, Lemlist, Customer.io) connected around Attio.Optimization &amp; RevOps: Dashboards, automation, reporting and process redesign to improve clarity and performance.App &amp; API Integrations: Structured integrations via API or native Attio App SDK when required.We’re one of the most experienced Attio-focused teams worldwide:100% specialized in AttioDeeply embedded in the productIn close contact with the Attio teamWhile Attio is our sole CRM focus, we understand every major CRM platform — enabling smooth migrations and thoughtful GTM architecture.Our systems are designed to be powerful and maintainable:Modular and scalableAPI-connected where neededNo-code when it’s the smartest pathFounded by Giacomo Caranese, one of the earliest Attio Experts, the team combines GTM strategy, RevOps architecture and hands-on technical execution.Our typical missionsImplement Attio from scratch - For teams adopting their first structured CRM. Data model, pipelines, automation and clean imports.Migrate from a legacy CRM - For companies moving from Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity or Zoho. End-to-end migration with data restructuring and controlled rollout.Improve an existing setup - For teams already using Attio. Audit, dashboard redesign and workflow optimization.Connect your GTM stack - For sales and growth teams. Integration of Clay, Lemlist, Customer.io via API or native SDK.Build an outbound engine - For teams generating qualified leads. ICP sourcing, enrichment and automated outreach fully integrated.Next stepsClick the link on the left to book your free 30-minute Discovery Call.We assess your CRM and GTM setup.You receive a clear scope and personalized proposal.👉 Book your free 30-minute Discovery Call and let’s design the right Attio system for your growth."},{id:"129c1045-e497-480d-a728-8b5d66855625",name:bf,slug:"neon-deer-data-labs",image:"contact_images\u002F129c1045-e497-480d-a728-8b5d66855625\u002Fe2da83bf-acd1-4b68-b104-5b111adafff9.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EWe&#39;re a data engineering consultancy specializing in complex CRM configurations. We partner closely with Marketing, Sales, and Success teams to implement scalable tools and data processes. \u003Cstrong\u003EOur top priority is helping you realize value from Attio as quickly as possible.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E In the first week of our engagement, we&#39;ll tackle your biggest challenges and identify quick wins to help you see immediate progress.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E👉 \u003Cstrong\u003EHOW TO GET YOUR PROJECT STARTED:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHere&#39;s how we work with new clients:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiscovery Call\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Use the link in the &quot;Resources&quot; section to book your free 30 minute session. We&#39;ll use this time to understand your goals and determine if we&#39;re the right fit for your needs.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkshop\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E [optional]:\u003Cstrong\u003E \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EFollowing the Discovery Call, we&#39;ll schedule a free 60 minute workshop to build a custom roadmap for your specific Attio needs. If you have a simple project, we&#39;ll skip this and get started right away.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProposal\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Following the workshop, we&#39;ll provide a detailed quote within hours.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProject kick-off\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. As soon as you&#39;re ready to start, so are we.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E👉 ONLY NEED A ONE-OFF CONSULTATION?\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESometimes you just need focused, expert time to unblock, align, or accelerate your work. \u003Cstrong\u003EBook 45-60 minutes with us to get targeted help \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003Ewith your Attio CRM: build from scratch, or optimize what’s live. These sessions exist because small, well-guided interventions often unlock disproportionate progress.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E👉 \u003Cstrong\u003EOUR SERVICES\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe specialize in assisting clients with complex CRM migration requirements, and those with existing Attio configurations who are seeking more advanced setups (especially with third party integrations.)\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECRM Migrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Move your data and processes from HubSpot, Salesforce, or any other CRM into Attio with minimal disruption.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAutomations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Leverage AI, reduce manual tasks, streamline operations, and keep important work from slipping through the cracks.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExternal Integrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Keep your CRM connected to any external tool. We configure data pipelines, ETL, AI platforms, and other custom setups using solutions that can be maintained and easily built upon in the future.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAudits\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Evaluate the health of your Attio setup with a comprehensive audit. We&#39;ll assess data structure, automation efficiency, and integrations to identify gaps and opportunities for improvement.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOngoing Support\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E: Our commitment doesn&#39;t end after the initial project completes. We&#39;re here to ensure long-term success with expert guidance and hands-on support.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:41,tier:{name:s,imageUrl:bd},countryName:y,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bf,highlightedDescription:"We&#39;re a data engineering consultancy specializing in complex CRM configurations. We partner closely with Marketing, Sales, and Success teams to implement scalable tools and data processes. Our top priority is helping you realize value from Attio as quickly as possible. In the first week of our engagement, we&#39;ll tackle your biggest challenges and identify quick wins to help you see immediate progress.👉 HOW TO GET YOUR PROJECT STARTED:Here&#39;s how we work with new clients:Discovery Call: Use the link in the &quot;Resources&quot; section to book your free 30 minute session. We&#39;ll use this time to understand your goals and determine if we&#39;re the right fit for your needs.Workshop [optional]: Following the Discovery Call, we&#39;ll schedule a free 60 minute workshop to build a custom roadmap for your specific Attio needs. If you have a simple project, we&#39;ll skip this and get started right away.Proposal: Following the workshop, we&#39;ll provide a detailed quote within hours.Project kick-off. As soon as you&#39;re ready to start, so are we.👉 ONLY NEED A ONE-OFF CONSULTATION?Sometimes you just need focused, expert time to unblock, align, or accelerate your work. Book 45-60 minutes with us to get targeted help with your Attio CRM: build from scratch, or optimize what’s live. These sessions exist because small, well-guided interventions often unlock disproportionate progress.👉 OUR SERVICES:We specialize in assisting clients with complex CRM migration requirements, and those with existing Attio configurations who are seeking more advanced setups (especially with third party integrations.)CRM Migrations: Move your data and processes from HubSpot, Salesforce, or any other CRM into Attio with minimal disruption.Automations: Leverage AI, reduce manual tasks, streamline operations, and keep important work from slipping through the cracks.External Integrations: Keep your CRM connected to any external tool. We configure data pipelines, ETL, AI platforms, and other custom setups using solutions that can be maintained and easily built upon in the future.Audits: Evaluate the health of your Attio setup with a comprehensive audit. We&#39;ll assess data structure, automation efficiency, and integrations to identify gaps and opportunities for improvement.Ongoing Support: Our commitment doesn&#39;t end after the initial project completes. We&#39;re here to ensure long-term success with expert guidance and hands-on support."},{id:"055bf5f8-4d47-4a0f-af61-9142675ae3cb",name:bg,slug:"dialed-technologies",image:"contact_images\u002F055bf5f8-4d47-4a0f-af61-9142675ae3cb\u002Fd222d039-2a79-45d4-9419-fea9b3a74782.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EWe are the first software developer-run Attio agency. Both co-founders had careers in software development before entering the Attio world. Through our technical-first approach we&#39;ve leveraged code to build systems that streamline everything from complex CRM migrations to custom Attio apps.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur Offerings\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFoundation &amp; Setup\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EComplete workspace design\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EData migrations from other CRMs\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECustom data architecture\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeam onboarding\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProcess documentation\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECustom Development &amp; Integration\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENative Attio SDK apps (published marketplace integrations)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EComplex API integrations\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBespoke automation workflows\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECustom data enrichment\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdvanced analytics dashboards\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDe-Duplication\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExpert-guided de-duplication platform for Attio combining advanced algorithms with specialist support\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhy Choose Dialed\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBest-in-class on one platform.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We&#39;re all-in on Attio not generalists across multiple CRMs. This exclusive focus means deeper expertise and solutions that leverage Attio&#39;s full potential.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETechnical &amp; foundational.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Our implementations start with proper data architecture, ensuring your system scales as your needs evolve. When you&#39;re ready for custom apps or integrations, we&#39;re already deeply familiar with your setup.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorking milestones, not endless projects.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We work in 2-week sprints to deliver functional systems you can use immediately. This allows you to test new functionality, provide feedback based on real usage, and stay in control of timeline and budget.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur Process\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFree 30-min discovery call\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETechnical planning &amp; sprint breakdown\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESame-day proposal with milestones\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E2-week sprint execution deliver functional milestone\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour team uses it, we schedule next sprint when ready\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIdeal For\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENew Attio customers wanting expert setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInvestment firms transitioning from Affinity\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams needing complex integrations\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOrganizations requiring custom applications\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBusinesses valuing iterative development\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:bh,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:y,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bg,highlightedDescription:"We are the first software developer-run Attio agency. Both co-founders had careers in software development before entering the Attio world. Through our technical-first approach we&#39;ve leveraged code to build systems that streamline everything from complex CRM migrations to custom Attio apps.Our OfferingsFoundation &amp; SetupComplete workspace designData migrations from other CRMsCustom data architectureTeam onboardingProcess documentationCustom Development &amp; IntegrationNative Attio SDK apps (published marketplace integrations)Complex API integrationsBespoke automation workflowsCustom data enrichmentAdvanced analytics dashboardsDe-DuplicationExpert-guided de-duplication platform for Attio combining advanced algorithms with specialist supportWhy Choose DialedBest-in-class on one platform. We&#39;re all-in on Attio not generalists across multiple CRMs. This exclusive focus means deeper expertise and solutions that leverage Attio&#39;s full potential.Technical &amp; foundational. Our implementations start with proper data architecture, ensuring your system scales as your needs evolve. When you&#39;re ready for custom apps or integrations, we&#39;re already deeply familiar with your setup.Working milestones, not endless projects. We work in 2-week sprints to deliver functional systems you can use immediately. This allows you to test new functionality, provide feedback based on real usage, and stay in control of timeline and budget.Our ProcessFree 30-min discovery callTechnical planning &amp; sprint breakdownSame-day proposal with milestones2-week sprint execution deliver functional milestoneYour team uses it, we schedule next sprint when readyIdeal ForNew Attio customers wanting expert setupInvestment firms transitioning from AffinityTeams needing complex integrationsOrganizations requiring custom applicationsBusinesses valuing iterative development"},{id:"4ad9a8ee-79a5-46f6-be42-e82342b8f779",name:bi,slug:"sideways-crm",image:"contact_images\u002F4ad9a8ee-79a5-46f6-be42-e82342b8f779\u002Fa2367277-ffe8-491e-b39e-cc52ea690479.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Attio specialist for investment and advisory firms. 35 successful Attio setups since 2023.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYour network is already your edge. I build the system that puts it to work - the right conversations surfaced faster, the connections others miss made visible, and nothing lost.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor firms where deals come from relationships - \u003Cstrong\u003Einvestors, advisers, brokers, dealmakers\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - I help you capture everything (relationships, conversations, history, documents), surface the connections others miss, and turn it into a system that compounds the more you use it. Built around how your firm actually works, not a generic sales funnel.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYou work directly with me, a \u003Cstrong\u003EFounding Attio Expert Partner\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E who understands this world and owns the outcome - and brings in trusted specialists when the work calls for it, so you get senior judgement without ever managing a developer.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEvery engagement starts with a \u003Cstrong\u003Efree 20-minute scoping session\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, moving to a Project to Partnership model - a clear first build, then an ongoing partnership to keep it sharp. Tell me where you are and what you&#39;re trying to achieve, and I&#39;ll come back with clear recommendations and next steps.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E35+ successful implementations across M&amp;A advisors, brokers, consulting firms, investment funds, VCs and boutique advisory.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E---\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E🗲 Book a free scoping session\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E where we&#39;ll discuss your current setup and ambitions for Attio. You&#39;ll leave with clear recommended next steps.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E---\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E↳ Visit my website to learn more and get in touch\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:bh,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:I,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bi,highlightedDescription:"The Attio specialist for investment and advisory firms. 35 successful Attio setups since 2023.Your network is already your edge. I build the system that puts it to work - the right conversations surfaced faster, the connections others miss made visible, and nothing lost.For firms where deals come from relationships - investors, advisers, brokers, dealmakers - I help you capture everything (relationships, conversations, history, documents), surface the connections others miss, and turn it into a system that compounds the more you use it. Built around how your firm actually works, not a generic sales funnel.You work directly with me, a Founding Attio Expert Partner who understands this world and owns the outcome - and brings in trusted specialists when the work calls for it, so you get senior judgement without ever managing a developer.Every engagement starts with a free 20-minute scoping session, moving to a Project to Partnership model - a clear first build, then an ongoing partnership to keep it sharp. Tell me where you are and what you&#39;re trying to achieve, and I&#39;ll come back with clear recommendations and next steps.35+ successful implementations across M&amp;A advisors, brokers, consulting firms, investment funds, VCs and boutique advisory.---🗲 Book a free scoping session where we&#39;ll discuss your current setup and ambitions for Attio. You&#39;ll leave with clear recommended next steps.---↳ Visit my website to learn more and get in touch"},{id:"9be70224-c48e-4379-bf7a-1ec04989fd6f",name:bj,slug:"revautex",image:"contact_images\u002F9be70224-c48e-4379-bf7a-1ec04989fd6f\u002F57de0fea-5664-4429-85db-997482cfd291.jpeg",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EI&#39;m Kayla Campos, Founder of Revautex and I design and implement Attio-based GTM systems for teams that have outgrown their CRM or spreadsheets.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWith a background in business development and sales, I build systems from the operator&#39;s perspective: clean data models, automations that actually run, and reporting your team will use.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHOW WE CAN HELP:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAttio setup, migration, and optimization - custom objects, attributes, pipelines, lifecycle logic, workflows, AI attributes \u002F features, and reporting completely tailored to your business\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntegrations via tools like n8n or Zapier - connecting Attio to any platform with an open API\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETraining, documentation, and recorded walkthroughs for smooth team adoption\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWHO WE WORK WITH:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFounders, sales teams, and ops teams across SaaS, AI, fintech, agencies, and more, who need a strong GTM foundation without the overhead of a full RevOps hire.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHOW TO GET STARTED:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBook Intro Call. \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EWe&#39;ll discuss your business, goals and current setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStrategy &amp; Process Mapping Workshop. \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EFor implementation projects, we’ll spend 90 mins with you to deep dive into your business, map out your process in real-time using a flowchart and design a clear Attio structure that makes sense for your business model.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProposal. \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003ESent within 24 hours of the workshop, scoped to what we discussed in the workshop.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProject Launch. \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003EBecause we mapped everything in the workshop, we hit the ground running immediately\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:13,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:bk,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bj,highlightedDescription:"I&#39;m Kayla Campos, Founder of Revautex and I design and implement Attio-based GTM systems for teams that have outgrown their CRM or spreadsheets.With a background in business development and sales, I build systems from the operator&#39;s perspective: clean data models, automations that actually run, and reporting your team will use.HOW WE CAN HELP:Attio setup, migration, and optimization - custom objects, attributes, pipelines, lifecycle logic, workflows, AI attributes \u002F features, and reporting completely tailored to your businessIntegrations via tools like n8n or Zapier - connecting Attio to any platform with an open APITraining, documentation, and recorded walkthroughs for smooth team adoptionWHO WE WORK WITH:Founders, sales teams, and ops teams across SaaS, AI, fintech, agencies, and more, who need a strong GTM foundation without the overhead of a full RevOps hire.HOW TO GET STARTED:Book Intro Call. We&#39;ll discuss your business, goals and current setupStrategy &amp; Process Mapping Workshop. For implementation projects, we’ll spend 90 mins with you to deep dive into your business, map out your process in real-time using a flowchart and design a clear Attio structure that makes sense for your business model.Proposal. Sent within 24 hours of the workshop, scoped to what we discussed in the workshop.Project Launch. Because we mapped everything in the workshop, we hit the ground running immediately"},{id:"c11b60b1-cbb3-4929-bdb4-01d6b67fc4fb",name:bl,slug:"crawl-walk-run",image:"contact_images\u002Fc11b60b1-cbb3-4929-bdb4-01d6b67fc4fb\u002F7eeffdad-8cbe-4141-86bc-f32b3b198e17.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAPAC&#39;s first Attio Expert Partner.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe help businesses across Australia and the wider APAC region move onto Attio and get real value from it, one step at a time. That is the idea behind our name. Crawl, then walk, then run. We start where you are, build solid foundations, and grow the system as your business does.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAfter more than a decade inside the Salesforce ecosystem, we built Crawl Walk Run because CRM consulting was overdue for a rethink. Bloated teams, open ended timelines, and go-lives the vendor celebrated while the team quietly went back to their spreadsheets. Attio changed what was possible. A platform intuitive enough that a small, senior team can design, build and hand over a working system without the overhead traditional CRM consulting demands.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe offer straightforward, fixed price projects and delivery completed in weeks. \u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat we deliver\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImplementation:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Full Attio setup tailored to how your business actually works, configured and deployed end to end.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EData migration:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Clean, controlled moves from HubSpot, Salesforce, Affinity, Pipedrive, Monday.com and more, with your data intact.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIntegration:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Attio connected to the tools you already use, via Zapier, n8n or API.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI-powered workflows:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Automations built with Claude, ChatGPT and Attio&#39;s native AI to handle workflows including automated personalised engagement, forecasting, strategy and document generation.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProcess design:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Workflows and automations shaped around your business, not a generic template.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOngoing support:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Light touch or hands on, keeping your system sharp as your needs change.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraining and enablement:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Your team confident and self sufficient in Attio, from the basics to advanced features.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHow we work\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E100% focused on Attio, deeply embedded in the product and in regular contact with the Attio team.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFixed price and phased, so you always know what you are getting and what it costs.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERight sized to where you are today, with room to scale when you are ready.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENext steps\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBook a free discovery call at crawlwalkrun.co\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWe learn how your business works and where Attio fits.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYou get a clear scope and a fixed-price proposal.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReady to get more from your customer relationships? Book your free discovery call and let&#39;s map the right Attio system for your business.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:J,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:bm,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bl,highlightedDescription:"APAC&#39;s first Attio Expert Partner.We help businesses across Australia and the wider APAC region move onto Attio and get real value from it, one step at a time. That is the idea behind our name. Crawl, then walk, then run. We start where you are, build solid foundations, and grow the system as your business does.After more than a decade inside the Salesforce ecosystem, we built Crawl Walk Run because CRM consulting was overdue for a rethink. Bloated teams, open ended timelines, and go-lives the vendor celebrated while the team quietly went back to their spreadsheets. Attio changed what was possible. A platform intuitive enough that a small, senior team can design, build and hand over a working system without the overhead traditional CRM consulting demands.We offer straightforward, fixed price projects and delivery completed in weeks. What we deliverImplementation: Full Attio setup tailored to how your business actually works, configured and deployed end to end.Data migration: Clean, controlled moves from HubSpot, Salesforce, Affinity, Pipedrive, Monday.com and more, with your data intact.Integration: Attio connected to the tools you already use, via Zapier, n8n or API.AI-powered workflows: Automations built with Claude, ChatGPT and Attio&#39;s native AI to handle workflows including automated personalised engagement, forecasting, strategy and document generation.Process design: Workflows and automations shaped around your business, not a generic template.Ongoing support: Light touch or hands on, keeping your system sharp as your needs change.Training and enablement: Your team confident and self sufficient in Attio, from the basics to advanced features.How we work100% focused on Attio, deeply embedded in the product and in regular contact with the Attio team.Fixed price and phased, so you always know what you are getting and what it costs.Right sized to where you are today, with room to scale when you are ready.Next stepsBook a free discovery call at crawlwalkrun.coWe learn how your business works and where Attio fits.You get a clear scope and a fixed-price proposal.Ready to get more from your customer relationships? Book your free discovery call and let&#39;s map the right Attio system for your business."},{id:"68188d5e-cfc3-46ab-9a9f-5b8801245fc4",name:bn,slug:"kops",image:"contact_images\u002F68188d5e-cfc3-46ab-9a9f-5b8801245fc4\u002F0a617009-b68b-468d-ba1c-1a70f0dab482.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EWe help SaaS companies and B2B agencies build GTM systems that actually drive revenue with Attio as the backbone of your sales operations.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWith 8+ years of experience in CRM implementation and optimization, we’v helped 50+ clients turn their CRM into a real sales machine.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYour setups are scalable, simple to use, and designed for your team to stay autonomous.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E⭐️ What we do best\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFull implementation (from 0 to 100) : Structure design, best-practice consulting, and complete Attio setup.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExisting CRM optimization : Make your CRM cleaner, faster, and directly increase your revenue.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPremium &amp; fast migrations : From HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Notion, GIL, and more — with zero data loss.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E🔥 Going further (if you need it)\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdvanced lead scoring to prioritize your pipeline\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimple or complex automations (sales, marketing, nurturing)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmart integrations (outbound, calling tools, marketing stack, internal tools)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEnrichment &amp; intent data to target better and sell faster\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EReporting &amp; forecasting to track your sales activity precisely\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E💟 Why work with us?\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E💼 8+ years of CRM experience\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🚀 50+ SaaS &amp; B2B agency clients\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E📚 Clear documentation &amp; training included\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E💬 Dedicated WhatsApp support (Mon–Fri) during the project\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⚡ Fast onboarding — first results in just a few days\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ How we work (our Roadmap)\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAudit &amp; scoping – We map your goals and processes\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStructure design – Clean, business-oriented architecture\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETechnical implementation – Solid, scalable, and ready to use\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDocumentation &amp; training – So your team stays autonomous\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOptimization &amp; ongoing support (optional) – Continuous improvements as you grow\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:z,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:be,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bn,highlightedDescription:"We help SaaS companies and B2B agencies build GTM systems that actually drive revenue with Attio as the backbone of your sales operations.With 8+ years of experience in CRM implementation and optimization, we’v helped 50+ clients turn their CRM into a real sales machine.Your setups are scalable, simple to use, and designed for your team to stay autonomous.⭐️ What we do bestFull implementation (from 0 to 100) : Structure design, best-practice consulting, and complete Attio setup.Existing CRM optimization : Make your CRM cleaner, faster, and directly increase your revenue.Premium &amp; fast migrations : From HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Notion, GIL, and more — with zero data loss.🔥 Going further (if you need it)Advanced lead scoring to prioritize your pipelineSimple or complex automations (sales, marketing, nurturing)Smart integrations (outbound, calling tools, marketing stack, internal tools)Enrichment &amp; intent data to target better and sell fasterReporting &amp; forecasting to track your sales activity precisely💟 Why work with us?💼 8+ years of CRM experience🚀 50+ SaaS &amp; B2B agency clients📚 Clear documentation &amp; training included💬 Dedicated WhatsApp support (Mon–Fri) during the project⚡ Fast onboarding — first results in just a few days✅ How we work (our Roadmap)Audit &amp; scoping – We map your goals and processesStructure design – Clean, business-oriented architectureTechnical implementation – Solid, scalable, and ready to useDocumentation &amp; training – So your team stays autonomousOptimization &amp; ongoing support (optional) – Continuous improvements as you grow"},{id:"ab9e93b6-157d-475e-9a0b-55d828a61dd9",name:bo,slug:"marco-serafini",image:"contact_images\u002Fab9e93b6-157d-475e-9a0b-55d828a61dd9\u002Feff1938c-fb3f-484e-bd6e-367bd762d534.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe architect the operational backbone that lets you scale revenue without scaling chaos.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENovrith is a specialized Business Operations Agency, and Attio is the command center we build around. We help digital agencies, SaaS companies, B2B tech businesses, and tech startups turn Attio into the strategic hub of an integrated operational ecosystem — not a standalone CRM, but the source of truth connecting sales, delivery, and data across the business.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur approach — systems, not tools:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERevenue infrastructure in Attio\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E — data architecture, pipelines, automations, and team permissions built for how your business actually sells and delivers\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEcosystem integrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E — Attio connected to your work management, automation, enrichment, and outbound layers so data moves without human babysitting\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECRM migrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E — clean, opinionated moves from legacy CRMs into a modern Attio setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI where it pays off\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E — embedded into workflows to eliminate manual work, not bolted on for its own sake\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat makes working with us different:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe don&#39;t just configure Attio. We build systems around it. Every implementation is designed to compound as you scale, with real team adoption, clean documentation, and a partnership model that keeps evolving the system after go-live.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⇨ \u003Cstrong\u003EWHO WE WORK WITH\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDigital agencies, SaaS companies, B2B tech businesses, and tech startups\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams actively scaling and hitting bottlenecks in lead management, sales process, or cross-team handoffs\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFounder-led teams without an in-house RevOps function that want enterprise-grade foundations without the overhead\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECompanies that want Attio set up properly from day one\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⇨ \u003Cstrong\u003EHOW TO GET STARTED\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBook a free discovery call (link on the left)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWe map your operations and identify where Attio becomes the lever\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYou receive a tailored plan — ready to execute, with clear milestones\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E⇨ \u003Cstrong\u003EKEY DELIVERABLES\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EComplete Attio workspace: data architecture, lists, pipelines, automations, team permissions\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntegrated RevOps workflows connecting sales, delivery, and operations\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECustom integrations and automated data flows across your stack\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMigration from legacy CRMs to a properly designed Attio setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContinuous optimization and scaling support\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EReady to make Attio the operational backbone of your business? Let&#39;s build a system that scales with you.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:A,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:"Italy",npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bo,highlightedDescription:"We architect the operational backbone that lets you scale revenue without scaling chaos.Novrith is a specialized Business Operations Agency, and Attio is the command center we build around. We help digital agencies, SaaS companies, B2B tech businesses, and tech startups turn Attio into the strategic hub of an integrated operational ecosystem — not a standalone CRM, but the source of truth connecting sales, delivery, and data across the business.Our approach — systems, not tools:Revenue infrastructure in Attio — data architecture, pipelines, automations, and team permissions built for how your business actually sells and deliversEcosystem integrations — Attio connected to your work management, automation, enrichment, and outbound layers so data moves without human babysittingCRM migrations — clean, opinionated moves from legacy CRMs into a modern Attio setupAI where it pays off — embedded into workflows to eliminate manual work, not bolted on for its own sakeWhat makes working with us different:We don&#39;t just configure Attio. We build systems around it. Every implementation is designed to compound as you scale, with real team adoption, clean documentation, and a partnership model that keeps evolving the system after go-live.⇨ WHO WE WORK WITHDigital agencies, SaaS companies, B2B tech businesses, and tech startupsTeams actively scaling and hitting bottlenecks in lead management, sales process, or cross-team handoffsFounder-led teams without an in-house RevOps function that want enterprise-grade foundations without the overheadCompanies that want Attio set up properly from day one⇨ HOW TO GET STARTEDBook a free discovery call (link on the left)We map your operations and identify where Attio becomes the leverYou receive a tailored plan — ready to execute, with clear milestones⇨ KEY DELIVERABLESComplete Attio workspace: data architecture, lists, pipelines, automations, team permissionsIntegrated RevOps workflows connecting sales, delivery, and operationsCustom integrations and automated data flows across your stackMigration from legacy CRMs to a properly designed Attio setupContinuous optimization and scaling supportReady to make Attio the operational backbone of your business? Let&#39;s build a system that scales with you."},{id:"49156b31-87c2-4c28-afd5-8412acd242ad",name:bp,slug:"attimize",image:"contact_images\u002F49156b31-87c2-4c28-afd5-8412acd242ad\u002F7f3b4fa1-ce1e-4b91-81e3-9368a4cf2b4f.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cstrong\u003E9 years of expertise in the CRM space\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, we specialize in helping businesses streamline their customer relationship management, optimize workflows, and scale operations efficiently. We have worked with \u003Cstrong\u003Elarge enterprises like Sonos and Gopuff\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, as well as \u003Cstrong\u003Esmaller, fast-growing companies like Retention, StoryBoard and Cresta\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E delivering tailored CRM solutions that drive results.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHaving supported \u003Cstrong\u003Eover 150 clients across multiple CRMs\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, we bring deep technical knowledge, strategic insights, and hands-on experience to every engagement. Whether it’s \u003Cstrong\u003Eimplementing, customizing, or automating CRM systems\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, we ensure businesses get the most out of their tools while improving productivity, collaboration, and customer insights.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOur mission is simple: to \u003Cstrong\u003Eempower businesses with smarter, more efficient CRM solutions\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E that fuel growth and long-term success.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHow We Help\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🔧 \u003Cstrong\u003ECustom Attio Workspaces\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Designing, optimizing, and structuring Attio databases to fit your business needs, including audits, clean-ups, and workflow strategy.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🧠 \u003Cstrong\u003ECRM &amp; Data Management\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Organizing and streamlining client relationships, sales pipelines, and team collaboration with Attio’s powerful features, enhanced with AI-driven insights.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🤝 \u003Cstrong\u003ETeam Training &amp; Adoption\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Guiding teams through Attio implementation, change management, and best practices to ensure smooth adoption and maximum efficiency.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E🔗 \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomation &amp; Integrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Connecting Attio with key tools like Zapier, Slack, Google Workspace, and other platforms to automate repetitive tasks and improve productivity.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E📦 \u003Cstrong\u003EMigration, Maintenance &amp; Scalability\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Seamlessly migrating data into Attio, ensuring long-term performance, and scaling systems as your business grows.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:o,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:y,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bp,highlightedDescription:"With 9 years of expertise in the CRM space, we specialize in helping businesses streamline their customer relationship management, optimize workflows, and scale operations efficiently. We have worked with large enterprises like Sonos and Gopuff, as well as smaller, fast-growing companies like Retention, StoryBoard and Cresta delivering tailored CRM solutions that drive results.Having supported over 150 clients across multiple CRMs, we bring deep technical knowledge, strategic insights, and hands-on experience to every engagement. Whether it’s implementing, customizing, or automating CRM systems, we ensure businesses get the most out of their tools while improving productivity, collaboration, and customer insights.Our mission is simple: to empower businesses with smarter, more efficient CRM solutions that fuel growth and long-term success.How We Help🔧 Custom Attio Workspaces – Designing, optimizing, and structuring Attio databases to fit your business needs, including audits, clean-ups, and workflow strategy.🧠 CRM &amp; Data Management – Organizing and streamlining client relationships, sales pipelines, and team collaboration with Attio’s powerful features, enhanced with AI-driven insights.🤝 Team Training &amp; Adoption – Guiding teams through Attio implementation, change management, and best practices to ensure smooth adoption and maximum efficiency.🔗 Automation &amp; Integrations – Connecting Attio with key tools like Zapier, Slack, Google Workspace, and other platforms to automate repetitive tasks and improve productivity.📦 Migration, Maintenance &amp; Scalability – Seamlessly migrating data into Attio, ensuring long-term performance, and scaling systems as your business grows."},{id:"0d3fc052-67bb-479b-a4da-a27c00b96693",name:bq,slug:"working-mono",image:"contact_images\u002F0d3fc052-67bb-479b-a4da-a27c00b96693\u002Fdcb06c2e-06b3-4f90-80d8-52d3cff6369d.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EAbout Working Mono\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWorking Mono helps high-growth B2B teams make Attio the frontend for the commercial system underneath it: product usage, customer context, billing, support, enrichment, routing, lifecycle state, reporting, workflows, and AI-legible context.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe are an Attio Founding Expert Partner for teams where the question is not &quot;can someone configure the CRM?&quot; It is &quot;can Attio become the place our team and agents actually run the business from?&quot;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe technical lift sits with us. You bring the commercial context and decisions that matter. We design the architecture, manage integrations, turn product and revenue logic into workflows, and leave you with something your team can run.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EBest Fit\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPLG and usage-rich companies\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E that need product signals inside Attio.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFounder-led or scaling sales teams\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E moving from spreadsheets, memory, legacy CRM, or a tool stack nobody trusts into a real revenue system.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERevOps and GTM leaders\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E who need routing, reporting, enrichment, lifecycle, and workflow logic to line up.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI-native teams\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E that want Attio, Workflows, and connected agents to operate from reliable context.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWhat We Build Around Attio\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EData model:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E objects, fields, lists, relationships, permissions, and views your team will actually use.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESource map and migration: \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003ECRM, product analytics, billing, support, forms, enrichment, spreadsheets, and human knowledge.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProduct and customer signals:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E usage, activation, expansion, risk, renewal, and self-serve buyer signals.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkflows and agents:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E scoring, routing, enrichment, alerts, handoffs, lifecycle moves, and reporting loops.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI-legible commercial memory:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E traceable definitions and operating logic so Attio&#39;s AI features do not relearn the business every time.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EHow It Works\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe map the commercial terrain: what the team believes, what source systems prove, and where Attio needs to become the operating surface.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThen we build the foundation for you: data model, source map, migration or sync plan, first workflow, and operating logic your team can trust. Your team stays close to decisions, not buried in technical work.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWeekly Patches keep the system compounding as your product, market, team, and revenue motion change.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYou own the system:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E data model, source maps, workflows, docs, prompts, and infrastructure. Working Mono keeps it sharp.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003ENot A Fit\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe are not the right partner for cheap admin, basic field setup, or one-off dashboards. We are strongest when Attio needs to become the operating surface for a changing commercial motion.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:f,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:I,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bq,highlightedDescription:"About Working MonoWorking Mono helps high-growth B2B teams make Attio the frontend for the commercial system underneath it: product usage, customer context, billing, support, enrichment, routing, lifecycle state, reporting, workflows, and AI-legible context.We are an Attio Founding Expert Partner for teams where the question is not &quot;can someone configure the CRM?&quot; It is &quot;can Attio become the place our team and agents actually run the business from?&quot;The technical lift sits with us. You bring the commercial context and decisions that matter. We design the architecture, manage integrations, turn product and revenue logic into workflows, and leave you with something your team can run.Best FitPLG and usage-rich companies that need product signals inside Attio.Founder-led or scaling sales teams moving from spreadsheets, memory, legacy CRM, or a tool stack nobody trusts into a real revenue system.RevOps and GTM leaders who need routing, reporting, enrichment, lifecycle, and workflow logic to line up.AI-native teams that want Attio, Workflows, and connected agents to operate from reliable context.What We Build Around AttioData model: objects, fields, lists, relationships, permissions, and views your team will actually use.Source map and migration: CRM, product analytics, billing, support, forms, enrichment, spreadsheets, and human knowledge.Product and customer signals: usage, activation, expansion, risk, renewal, and self-serve buyer signals.Workflows and agents: scoring, routing, enrichment, alerts, handoffs, lifecycle moves, and reporting loops.AI-legible commercial memory: traceable definitions and operating logic so Attio&#39;s AI features do not relearn the business every time.How It WorksWe map the commercial terrain: what the team believes, what source systems prove, and where Attio needs to become the operating surface.Then we build the foundation for you: data model, source map, migration or sync plan, first workflow, and operating logic your team can trust. Your team stays close to decisions, not buried in technical work.Weekly Patches keep the system compounding as your product, market, team, and revenue motion change.You own the system: data model, source maps, workflows, docs, prompts, and infrastructure. Working Mono keeps it sharp.Not A FitWe are not the right partner for cheap admin, basic field setup, or one-off dashboards. We are strongest when Attio needs to become the operating surface for a changing commercial motion."},{id:"37098370-4a64-4644-8a99-2b7bd4ddb350",name:br,slug:"optemization",image:"contact_images\u002F6fb51452-57a7-4f73-aadc-3fca6dd532bd\u002FWordmark_Dark.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EOur team helps high-growth companies stop the chaos of scattered knowledge and doc dumps — so your company can get work done efficiently and adopt modern tech tools like Attio.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGet access to a team of automation engineers, workspace designers, and developers.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe’ll help you organize, streamline, and automate processes — tailored to how you want your company to work going forward.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWith a track record of successfully completing over 100 projects with more than 80 clients, we can help you get everyone’s nuanced workflows into a trusted workspace.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWork faster and more efficiently as a team — with less manual work, fewer mistakes, and a much better employee experience across teams.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe can help you with the following:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWorkspace development\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWorkspace design\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWorkspace automation and integrations\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWorkspace documentation\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMigrations \u002F integrations \u002F automations with other tools\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWorkspace monitoring and maintenance\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAttio training for teams\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENeed help with something else that’s not listed above? Reach out to us! We’d be happy to discuss what you had in mind.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:e,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:y,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:br,highlightedDescription:"Our team helps high-growth companies stop the chaos of scattered knowledge and doc dumps — so your company can get work done efficiently and adopt modern tech tools like Attio.Get access to a team of automation engineers, workspace designers, and developers.We’ll help you organize, streamline, and automate processes — tailored to how you want your company to work going forward.With a track record of successfully completing over 100 projects with more than 80 clients, we can help you get everyone’s nuanced workflows into a trusted workspace.Work faster and more efficiently as a team — with less manual work, fewer mistakes, and a much better employee experience across teams.We can help you with the following:Workspace developmentWorkspace designWorkspace automation and integrationsWorkspace documentationMigrations \u002F integrations \u002F automations with other toolsWorkspace monitoring and maintenanceAttio training for teamsNeed help with something else that’s not listed above? Reach out to us! We’d be happy to discuss what you had in mind."},{id:"16a9a9bf-d8a7-4013-abc9-54ea7dc84894",name:bs,slug:"the-workflow-company",image:"contact_images\u002F16a9a9bf-d8a7-4013-abc9-54ea7dc84894\u002F01b96b49-2b30-4f11-aa65-e508d7bb91e4.png",rating:d,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe turn your Attio workspace into an intelligent revenue engine.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Workflow Company specializes in \u003Cu\u003EAI-powered GTM automation for VC-backed startups and venture capital firms\u003C\u002Fu\u003E - organizations that need sophisticated technical solutions to match their growth ambitions and complex deal processes.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe architect advanced workflows that automatically discover opportunities, research prospects, and execute on GTM intelligence across your entire tech stack. From portfolio company outreach to LP relationship management to scaling startup sales motions, our AI systems handle the technical complexity while you focus on strategic decisions.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELed by operators with proven experience scaling GTM at Uber and YC-backed startups, we offer both project-based implementations and ongoing optimization subscriptions—giving you flexibility to choose the engagement model that fits your needs.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhat we bring to your Attio implementation:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Advanced AI Workflows\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Sophisticated automation that handles complex research, qualification, and enrichment tasks\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Revenue-First Design\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Every workflow is architected to generate pipeline and accelerate deals\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Battle-Tested Tech Stack\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – We bring a robust foundation using Clay, n8n, Node.js, Default, and others—ensuring your CRM and automation stays reliable as you scale\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Operator Perspective\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – We understand the unique challenges of high-growth environments because we&#39;ve scaled them ourselves\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Flexible Engagements\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Choose from project-based implementations or ongoing optimization subscriptions based on your needs\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E✅ Responsible Innovation\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E – Proud 1% for the Planet members, demonstrating that cutting-edge AI and environmental stewardship go hand in hand\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYour Attio workspace becomes the foundation for an intelligent system that works around the clock - identifying prospects, gathering insights, and surfacing opportunities so your team can focus on what they do best: closing deals and driving growth.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E👉 \u003Cstrong\u003ERead to get started?\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick on the &quot;Contact&quot; button and tell us a bit about yourself.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWe will then book a 30-minute discovery call where we&#39;ll explore your current GTM challenges, understand your growth objectives, and identify the highest-ROI opportunities for you.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:c,tier:{name:i,imageUrl:m},countryName:bk,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bs,highlightedDescription:"We turn your Attio workspace into an intelligent revenue engine.The Workflow Company specializes in AI-powered GTM automation for VC-backed startups and venture capital firms - organizations that need sophisticated technical solutions to match their growth ambitions and complex deal processes.We architect advanced workflows that automatically discover opportunities, research prospects, and execute on GTM intelligence across your entire tech stack. From portfolio company outreach to LP relationship management to scaling startup sales motions, our AI systems handle the technical complexity while you focus on strategic decisions.Led by operators with proven experience scaling GTM at Uber and YC-backed startups, we offer both project-based implementations and ongoing optimization subscriptions—giving you flexibility to choose the engagement model that fits your needs.What we bring to your Attio implementation:✅ Advanced AI Workflows – Sophisticated automation that handles complex research, qualification, and enrichment tasks✅ Revenue-First Design – Every workflow is architected to generate pipeline and accelerate deals✅ Battle-Tested Tech Stack – We bring a robust foundation using Clay, n8n, Node.js, Default, and others—ensuring your CRM and automation stays reliable as you scale✅ Operator Perspective – We understand the unique challenges of high-growth environments because we&#39;ve scaled them ourselves✅ Flexible Engagements – Choose from project-based implementations or ongoing optimization subscriptions based on your needs✅ Responsible Innovation – Proud 1% for the Planet members, demonstrating that cutting-edge AI and environmental stewardship go hand in handYour Attio workspace becomes the foundation for an intelligent system that works around the clock - identifying prospects, gathering insights, and surfacing opportunities so your team can focus on what they do best: closing deals and driving growth.👉 Read to get started?Click on the &quot;Contact&quot; button and tell us a bit about yourself.We will then book a 30-minute discovery call where we&#39;ll explore your current GTM challenges, understand your growth objectives, and identify the highest-ROI opportunities for you."},{id:"9350a8d8-7483-4a07-a17e-86fe064d8a19",name:bt,slug:"craftt",image:"contact_images\u002F9350a8d8-7483-4a07-a17e-86fe064d8a19\u002Fd9f6c42a-d18b-4de2-ba40-c4b9f7ec3f04.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003ECraftt is an AI-native Attio implementation agency.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe build Attio workspaces that run with AI agents, automation, and clean data. Go live in 7 business days, or you do not pay.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe work best with VCs, agencies, financial services companies, and growth-stage B2B teams.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWhat you get:\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAttio live in 7 days\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. We design your workspace, migrate data, build pipelines around how you sell, wire automations, and train your team.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI agents inside Attio\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. Deal review, meeting prep, pipeline hygiene, account research, follow-up drafting, and more.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECRM admin and optimization\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. Dashboards, reporting, workflow redesign, cleanup, and fractional CRM ops for teams already on Attio.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAutomation and workflow design\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. Sales follow-ups, lifecycle stages, internal handoffs, reporting triggers, and repeatable workflows that reduce manual work.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIntegrations and data architecture.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Custom objects, API workflows, connected tools, and clean migrations from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Close, Salesforce, Affinity, Sheets, and more.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWho we are\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECraftt is a focused team of 5 Attio specialists. Attio is our only CRM focus. We help startups and growth-stage teams build a CRM that is fast, structured, and scalable.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EWho we work with:\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EB2B SaaS, venture capital, insurance, recruiting, consulting, professional services, research, policy, and teams migrating from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity, Close, or Salesforce.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMost clients come to us with messy data, unclear pipelines, and manual work. We fix all three in one week.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003EOur missions:\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFree audit - $0\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. A written teardown of your Attio workspace in 48 hours, with the three highest-leverage fixes.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETune-up - $1,000\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. For teams already on Attio but set up wrong. We reconfigure the data model, rebuild workflows, retune up to three Claude agents, document everything, and hand it back.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E7-day Sprint - $2,000.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Full Attio build: migration, data model, pipelines, automations, integrations, six Claude skills, training, and a 30-day tune-up. Live in 7 business days, or you do not pay.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOperating layer - $900\u002Fmonth.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Monthly CRM ops: health reports, dashboards, new automations, deduplication, cleanup, and workflow improvements. Runs on your account, with no lock-in.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cu\u003ESpecial offer:\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGet a free 48-hour Attio audit. Within two business days, we send a written teardown covering what works, where data or pipelines leak revenue, and the three highest-impact fixes to ship this week.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFive free audit slots available each week.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:K,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:y,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bt,highlightedDescription:"Craftt is an AI-native Attio implementation agency.We build Attio workspaces that run with AI agents, automation, and clean data. Go live in 7 business days, or you do not pay.We work best with VCs, agencies, financial services companies, and growth-stage B2B teams.What you get:Attio live in 7 days. We design your workspace, migrate data, build pipelines around how you sell, wire automations, and train your team.AI agents inside Attio. Deal review, meeting prep, pipeline hygiene, account research, follow-up drafting, and more.CRM admin and optimization. Dashboards, reporting, workflow redesign, cleanup, and fractional CRM ops for teams already on Attio.Automation and workflow design. Sales follow-ups, lifecycle stages, internal handoffs, reporting triggers, and repeatable workflows that reduce manual work.Integrations and data architecture. Custom objects, API workflows, connected tools, and clean migrations from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Close, Salesforce, Affinity, Sheets, and more.Who we are:Craftt is a focused team of 5 Attio specialists. Attio is our only CRM focus. We help startups and growth-stage teams build a CRM that is fast, structured, and scalable.Who we work with:B2B SaaS, venture capital, insurance, recruiting, consulting, professional services, research, policy, and teams migrating from HubSpot, Pipedrive, Affinity, Close, or Salesforce.Most clients come to us with messy data, unclear pipelines, and manual work. We fix all three in one week.Our missions:Free audit - $0. A written teardown of your Attio workspace in 48 hours, with the three highest-leverage fixes.Tune-up - $1,000. For teams already on Attio but set up wrong. We reconfigure the data model, rebuild workflows, retune up to three Claude agents, document everything, and hand it back.7-day Sprint - $2,000. Full Attio build: migration, data model, pipelines, automations, integrations, six Claude skills, training, and a 30-day tune-up. Live in 7 business days, or you do not pay.Operating layer - $900\u002Fmonth. Monthly CRM ops: health reports, dashboards, new automations, deduplication, cleanup, and workflow improvements. Runs on your account, with no lock-in.Special offer:Get a free 48-hour Attio audit. Within two business days, we send a written teardown covering what works, where data or pipelines leak revenue, and the three highest-impact fixes to ship this week.Five free audit slots available each week."},{id:"00c9dc7b-4850-4bdc-870d-d2e80a5a37bf",name:bu,slug:"5050growth",image:"contact_images\u002F00c9dc7b-4850-4bdc-870d-d2e80a5a37bf\u002Fddbce335-3d61-4c6f-8b5d-1e566b82466d.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E5050Growth builds AI-first Attio CRMs. Plug-and-play systems for VC funds, private equity firms, and startup teams who want AI working in their CRM next week, not in 6 months.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E10+ live Attio implementations in production. Zero data loss across migrations.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFounder-led. No junior consultants.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBook a call: https:\u002F\u002Fcalendar.notion.so\u002Fmeet\u002Fnacholafuentemoreno\u002Fgtm-expert\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat we ship\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECustom workspace architecture: data model, lists, permissions, ownership rules, designed around how you actually operate, not a CRM template.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMigrations from HubSpot, Salesforce, Affinity, Pipedrive, Notion, and spreadsheets, with relationship history preserved.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe full GTM stack wired in: Clay for enrichment, Lemlist or HeyReach for outbound, n8n for orchestration, Intercom for CS, Stripe for billing, Granola for meetings.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAI agents on top: workflow automation, lead routing, deal-flow scoring.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHow we work\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E1-week sprints with fixed scope and a fixed price per phase.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E30-minute diagnostic first, then a tailored plan and quote by end of day.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKickoff inside 48 hours of approval.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYou own everything we build.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo retainer lock-in - we hate them as much as you do.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIndustries we know inside-out\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVenture capital: deal flow, LP commitments, portfolio oversight, board reporting.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate equity and family offices: intermediary tracking, manager tracking, distributions.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStartups and scale-ups: signup-to-revenue automation, churn prevention, pipeline architecture, full-funnel reporting.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOperating across Europe and Americas timezones. Languages: English, Spanish, German.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFree 30-minute diagnostic.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENo slide deck - honest read on whether Attio is even the right call.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBook on the left.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:J,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:"Germany",npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bu,highlightedDescription:"5050Growth builds AI-first Attio CRMs. Plug-and-play systems for VC funds, private equity firms, and startup teams who want AI working in their CRM next week, not in 6 months.10+ live Attio implementations in production. Zero data loss across migrations.Founder-led. No junior consultants.Book a call: https:\u002F\u002Fcalendar.notion.so\u002Fmeet\u002Fnacholafuentemoreno\u002Fgtm-expertWhat we shipCustom workspace architecture: data model, lists, permissions, ownership rules, designed around how you actually operate, not a CRM template.Migrations from HubSpot, Salesforce, Affinity, Pipedrive, Notion, and spreadsheets, with relationship history preserved.The full GTM stack wired in: Clay for enrichment, Lemlist or HeyReach for outbound, n8n for orchestration, Intercom for CS, Stripe for billing, Granola for meetings.AI agents on top: workflow automation, lead routing, deal-flow scoring.How we work1-week sprints with fixed scope and a fixed price per phase.30-minute diagnostic first, then a tailored plan and quote by end of day.Kickoff inside 48 hours of approval.You own everything we build.No retainer lock-in - we hate them as much as you do.Industries we know inside-outVenture capital: deal flow, LP commitments, portfolio oversight, board reporting.Private equity and family offices: intermediary tracking, manager tracking, distributions.Startups and scale-ups: signup-to-revenue automation, churn prevention, pipeline architecture, full-funnel reporting.Operating across Europe and Americas timezones. Languages: English, Spanish, German.Free 30-minute diagnostic.No slide deck - honest read on whether Attio is even the right call.Book on the left."},{id:"9349e42f-33aa-48ec-b286-42bfa527938e",name:aj,slug:aj,image:"contact_images\u002F9349e42f-33aa-48ec-b286-42bfa527938e\u002F26146229-3c67-47ba-99bb-10a643d52e83.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe build the system your revenue runs on.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003Eprospr designs and builds go-to-market systems for B2B companies, transforming fragmented tools, disconnected workflows, and unreliable data into a unified system of action. By combining CRM architecture, revenue operations, automation, and AI, we create scalable operating systems that align all processes around a single source of truth, enabling faster execution, better decision-making, and predictable revenue growth.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe&#39;ve sat in your seat.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe don&#39;t hand you a strategy deck and disappear. We&#39;ve owned pipeline, carried quota, and inherited the same broken CRMs and duct-taped stacks we now fix for a living. So we don&#39;t theorize about your revenue engine - we architect it, build it, and run it alongside your team for 90 days after launch, until it&#39;s fully theirs.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat we deliver\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERevenue architecture &amp; data modeling\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - objects and pipelines built around how your business actually operates, not generic CRM contacts and companies\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIntegrations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - your inbound and outbound stack unified into one workspace, every lead and record in sync\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAutomation &amp; AI agents\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - the system surfaces the next action on its own, instead of relying on memory\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMigration &amp; setup\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - clean moves off Affinity, HubSpot, spreadsheets, and legacy tools\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETraining &amp; ongoing operations\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E - we don&#39;t just build it; we make sure it gets adopted\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELet&#39;s build yours.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E👉 Contact us. We pressure test your current GTM and CRM setup, show you where it&#39;s leaking, and hand you a clear plan to build a revenue engine that runs.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:j,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:"Armenia",npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:aj,highlightedDescription:"We build the system your revenue runs on.prospr designs and builds go-to-market systems for B2B companies, transforming fragmented tools, disconnected workflows, and unreliable data into a unified system of action. By combining CRM architecture, revenue operations, automation, and AI, we create scalable operating systems that align all processes around a single source of truth, enabling faster execution, better decision-making, and predictable revenue growth.We&#39;ve sat in your seat.We don&#39;t hand you a strategy deck and disappear. We&#39;ve owned pipeline, carried quota, and inherited the same broken CRMs and duct-taped stacks we now fix for a living. So we don&#39;t theorize about your revenue engine - we architect it, build it, and run it alongside your team for 90 days after launch, until it&#39;s fully theirs.What we deliverRevenue architecture &amp; data modeling - objects and pipelines built around how your business actually operates, not generic CRM contacts and companiesIntegrations - your inbound and outbound stack unified into one workspace, every lead and record in syncAutomation &amp; AI agents - the system surfaces the next action on its own, instead of relying on memoryMigration &amp; setup - clean moves off Affinity, HubSpot, spreadsheets, and legacy toolsTraining &amp; ongoing operations - we don&#39;t just build it; we make sure it gets adoptedLet&#39;s build yours.👉 Contact us. We pressure test your current GTM and CRM setup, show you where it&#39;s leaking, and hand you a clear plan to build a revenue engine that runs."},{id:"8471ee0d-962b-4a71-821e-2239f497d413",name:bv,slug:"jorgen-barthel",image:"contact_images\u002F8471ee0d-962b-4a71-821e-2239f497d413\u002Fb3510c02-4f2e-4f30-bf56-115c6615e1f7.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExpertise in sales and software\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EI help companies improve their sales performance by designing and implementing effective sales processes, supported by CRM and sales intelligence software. Technology is never the goal in itself — it’s a means to create a structured, predictable, and scalable sales operation.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgile\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMy approach is based on the Agile methodology: building your sales process in short, impactful sprints. This saves time, boosts team adoption, and results in a process that truly works for you.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cu\u003ETime Savings\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis approach significantly reduces the time spent on documenting features and deliverables—especially since these often evolve during implementation.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cu\u003EAdoption\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUsers learn to master the CRM and other software step-by-step. This is not only more effective, but it also prevents the system from being perceived as a &#39;burden.&#39; Ensuring a smooth user experience is essential for success and addresses one of the most common reasons why CRMs are underutilized.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cu\u003EAutomations and Integrations\u003C\u002Fu\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBy initially working with systems independently, we only automate what is strictly necessary. Automation is a means to an end, not a goal in itself.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMission &amp; vision\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMy mission. Building a sales process that drives results, brings clarity, and is a joy to use.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMy vision. A good sales process is essential, but it doesn&#39;t have to be complicated. It should empower you, not hinder you.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:e,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:"Netherlands",npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bv,highlightedDescription:"Expertise in sales and softwareI help companies improve their sales performance by designing and implementing effective sales processes, supported by CRM and sales intelligence software. Technology is never the goal in itself — it’s a means to create a structured, predictable, and scalable sales operation.AgileMy approach is based on the Agile methodology: building your sales process in short, impactful sprints. This saves time, boosts team adoption, and results in a process that truly works for you.Time SavingsThis approach significantly reduces the time spent on documenting features and deliverables—especially since these often evolve during implementation.AdoptionUsers learn to master the CRM and other software step-by-step. This is not only more effective, but it also prevents the system from being perceived as a &#39;burden.&#39; Ensuring a smooth user experience is essential for success and addresses one of the most common reasons why CRMs are underutilized.Automations and IntegrationsBy initially working with systems independently, we only automate what is strictly necessary. Automation is a means to an end, not a goal in itself.Mission &amp; visionMy mission. Building a sales process that drives results, brings clarity, and is a joy to use.My vision. A good sales process is essential, but it doesn&#39;t have to be complicated. It should empower you, not hinder you."},{id:"83dfe7e8-2c9d-49b2-9c0d-ee2cd2e4ae24",name:bw,slug:"wintactix",image:"contact_images\u002F83dfe7e8-2c9d-49b2-9c0d-ee2cd2e4ae24\u002Fa4bcb22e-6878-437b-b5d6-fb4bca0b3a78.png",rating:f,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003EWe work with teams using Attio who have a clear direction for how they want their CRM to support the business, but need an experienced partner to turn that direction into a concrete system.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EClients work with us to crystallize their thinking. We help them reason through how the system should work across teams, make the necessary trade-offs explicit, and decide what to standardize versus where flexibility is worth keeping.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur philosophy\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe believe clients use Attio because they already trust the Attio brand.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Our role starts after that decision, by helping you get the maximum out of the platform you’ve chosen.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe believe most teams already have direction.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E What you need is help crystallizing that direction and turning it into something concrete inside Attio.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe believe teams add more tools because they don’t realize what their existing tools can handle.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E A big part of our work is showing you what can live inside Attio and helping you to commit to that.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe believe the most valuable part of consulting is thinking with the client.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E That means working through your ideas together, pressure-testing them, and making trade-offs explicit.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe believe clients want confidence.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Confidence that you&#39;re using Attio correctly, that your approach makes sense, and that your’re not painting yourselves into a corner without realizing it.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat we typically help with\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETurning a rough idea into a concrete Attio setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDefining objects, relationships, properties, and lists\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EReconciling how different teams view and use the same data\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDesigning schemas that can support real, day-to-day usage\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EImplementing larger, structured builds rather than lightweight configuration\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWho we’re a good fit for\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClients who want an experienced partner to work through the system with them and make clear, opinionated decisions on the setup\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams using Attio who have an idea of where they want to go, but aren’t confident they’re setting it up in the best way\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams who want trade-offs made explicit early, rather than discovering limitations later\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClients who want their approach sanity-checked and validated\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams using PostHog: we’re often a strong fit by default, as our sister agency focuses exclusively on PostHog consulting (HogHelper.com)\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWho we’re not a good fit for\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEmail sequencing and outbound execution\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOutreach copywriting or campaign management\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall, one-off configuration tasks\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeams without clear ownership or intent on what they want to build\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENext steps\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf this sounds like a fit, head to our website and book a call.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:e,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:I,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bw,highlightedDescription:"We work with teams using Attio who have a clear direction for how they want their CRM to support the business, but need an experienced partner to turn that direction into a concrete system.Clients work with us to crystallize their thinking. We help them reason through how the system should work across teams, make the necessary trade-offs explicit, and decide what to standardize versus where flexibility is worth keeping.Our philosophyWe believe clients use Attio because they already trust the Attio brand. Our role starts after that decision, by helping you get the maximum out of the platform you’ve chosen.We believe most teams already have direction. What you need is help crystallizing that direction and turning it into something concrete inside Attio.We believe teams add more tools because they don’t realize what their existing tools can handle. A big part of our work is showing you what can live inside Attio and helping you to commit to that.We believe the most valuable part of consulting is thinking with the client. That means working through your ideas together, pressure-testing them, and making trade-offs explicit.We believe clients want confidence. Confidence that you&#39;re using Attio correctly, that your approach makes sense, and that your’re not painting yourselves into a corner without realizing it.What we typically help withTurning a rough idea into a concrete Attio setupDefining objects, relationships, properties, and listsReconciling how different teams view and use the same dataDesigning schemas that can support real, day-to-day usageImplementing larger, structured builds rather than lightweight configurationWho we’re a good fit forClients who want an experienced partner to work through the system with them and make clear, opinionated decisions on the setupTeams using Attio who have an idea of where they want to go, but aren’t confident they’re setting it up in the best wayTeams who want trade-offs made explicit early, rather than discovering limitations laterClients who want their approach sanity-checked and validatedTeams using PostHog: we’re often a strong fit by default, as our sister agency focuses exclusively on PostHog consulting (HogHelper.com)Who we’re not a good fit forEmail sequencing and outbound executionOutreach copywriting or campaign managementSmall, one-off configuration tasksTeams without clear ownership or intent on what they want to buildNext stepsIf this sounds like a fit, head to our website and book a call."},{id:"4cc5372d-60d6-49e5-b924-17c38c1d4cc3",name:bx,slug:"fifty-one-degrees",image:"contact_images\u002F4cc5372d-60d6-49e5-b924-17c38c1d4cc3\u002F89e8164b-1745-41d3-80e1-ad12463b54cd.png",rating:d,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAt Fifty One Degrees we&#39;re Engineers by trade. Growth Practitioners by design. We build AI-integrated revenue engines on Attio.\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMost CRMs are static graveyards for data. We turn Attio into the high-velocity central nervous system of your business.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBased in London (Great Portland St) and New York (Broadway), \u003Cstrong\u003EFifty One Degrees\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E serves UK &amp; US businesses with turnovers between £5m and £250m.\u003Cem\u003E \u003C\u002Fem\u003EWe practice Radical Candour, and we don&#39;t care about billable hours; we care about tangible, measurable impact.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFounded by tech veterans who have scaled companies to process millions of customers and built 300-person analytics powerhouses, we understand the Legacy CRM Tax that kills growth.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe don&#39;t just \u003Cem\u003Eset up\u003C\u002Fem\u003E Attio; we engineer it to automate the tedious stuff, freeing your team for creative, high-value work.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHow We Work\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe move at the speed of your business using our Ship, Learn, Iterate framework:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiscovery Call:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Book a 30-minute session to audit your current GTM friction.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EProof of Concept (PoC):\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We build a functional &quot;vertical slice&quot; of your Attio workspace in \u003Cstrong\u003E2 weeks\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E to prove technical value.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Build:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E A fully integrated, AI-augmented deployment delivered in \u003Cstrong\u003E~6 weeks\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKnowledge Transfer:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We are Smart Enablers. We train your team to own the system so you aren&#39;t dependent on us forever.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Fol\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOur Expertise\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe specialise in high-stakes environments where data integrity and automation are non-negotiable:\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComplex Migrations:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Seamless transitions from Salesforce, HubSpot, Dynamics or Pipedrive without data loss or downtime.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAI Workforce Integration:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We are implementation partners for \u003Cstrong\u003EElevenLabs\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBland AI \u003C\u002Fstrong\u003Eand \u003Cstrong\u003ERelevance AI\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E. We deploy AI agents and voice AI that handle triage and outreach directly within Attio.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPredictive Modelling:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E We build custom ML models for \u003Cstrong\u003ETargeting, Lead Scoring\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EChurn Prediction\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E that live inside your Attio attributes.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVertical Specialisation:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Deep experience in \u003Cstrong\u003EFinancial Services\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E (FCA\u002FPRA compliance), \u003Cstrong\u003EHome Improvement\u002FConstruction\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E, and \u003Cstrong\u003EVC\u002FPrivate Equity\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E deal flow.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat We Deliver\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArchitected Workspaces:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Custom data models (Objects, Attributes, Lists) engineered for your specific business logic.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAutomated Workflows:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E End-to-end GTM loops—from inbound lead enrichment to automated outbound triggers.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Modern Data Stack:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Bi-directional syncs between Attio and your data warehouse (Snowflake, BigQuery) using dbt and custom pipelines.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESecurity &amp; Governance:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E Fortified setups designed for the EU AI Act and GDPR, ensuring your data is a proprietary asset, not a liability.\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:c,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:I,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:bx,highlightedDescription:"At Fifty One Degrees we&#39;re Engineers by trade. Growth Practitioners by design. We build AI-integrated revenue engines on Attio.Most CRMs are static graveyards for data. We turn Attio into the high-velocity central nervous system of your business.Based in London (Great Portland St) and New York (Broadway), Fifty One Degrees serves UK &amp; US businesses with turnovers between £5m and £250m. We practice Radical Candour, and we don&#39;t care about billable hours; we care about tangible, measurable impact.Founded by tech veterans who have scaled companies to process millions of customers and built 300-person analytics powerhouses, we understand the Legacy CRM Tax that kills growth.We don&#39;t just set up Attio; we engineer it to automate the tedious stuff, freeing your team for creative, high-value work.How We WorkWe move at the speed of your business using our Ship, Learn, Iterate framework:Discovery Call: Book a 30-minute session to audit your current GTM friction.Proof of Concept (PoC): We build a functional &quot;vertical slice&quot; of your Attio workspace in 2 weeks to prove technical value.The Build: A fully integrated, AI-augmented deployment delivered in ~6 weeks.Knowledge Transfer: We are Smart Enablers. We train your team to own the system so you aren&#39;t dependent on us forever.Our ExpertiseWe specialise in high-stakes environments where data integrity and automation are non-negotiable:Complex Migrations: Seamless transitions from Salesforce, HubSpot, Dynamics or Pipedrive without data loss or downtime.AI Workforce Integration: We are implementation partners for ElevenLabs, Bland AI and Relevance AI. We deploy AI agents and voice AI that handle triage and outreach directly within Attio.Predictive Modelling: We build custom ML models for Targeting, Lead Scoring and Churn Prediction that live inside your Attio attributes.Vertical Specialisation: Deep experience in Financial Services (FCA\u002FPRA compliance), Home Improvement\u002FConstruction, and VC\u002FPrivate Equity deal flow.What We DeliverArchitected Workspaces: Custom data models (Objects, Attributes, Lists) engineered for your specific business logic.Automated Workflows: End-to-end GTM loops—from inbound lead enrichment to automated outbound triggers.The Modern Data Stack: Bi-directional syncs between Attio and your data warehouse (Snowflake, BigQuery) using dbt and custom pipelines.Security &amp; Governance: Fortified setups designed for the EU AI Act and GDPR, ensuring your data is a proprietary asset, not a liability."},{id:"2d0d6d96-ae4e-4a34-a0fb-70039979ad05",name:by,slug:"carbon-edge",image:"contact_images\u002F2d0d6d96-ae4e-4a34-a0fb-70039979ad05\u002F172254b8-cf11-4c3b-8e27-6543b3521e0a.png",rating:d,aboutUs:"\u003Cp\u003ECarbon Edge is an Australian technology consultancy helping ambitious businesses transform their operations for an AI-driven world. We have worked with all top-tier CRMs and Attio is the strongest commercial and technical foundation available today. For this reason, Attio sits at the centre of our work as the modern CRM foundation our clients build on, then extend with AI agents, automations, and connected data across their entire stack.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe span three modes of engagement: strategic advisory, full delivery, and fractional CTO partnerships. Our work covers CRM and revenue ops, websites and e-commerce, custom applications, workflow automation, and AI integration. Always built as a connected ecosystem rather than a stack of disconnected tools.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe work with clients across finance, construction, health, agriculture, e-commerce, professional services, nonprofits and member organisations. Happy to collaborate with in-house teams or other agencies, particularly where modern CRM architecture and AI-powered go-to-market are central to the brief.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWe offer:\u003C\u002Fstrong\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFull Attio implementation, including data model design, pipeline architecture, automations, sequences, and reporting\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAI agent and workflow design using Claude, n8n, and Attio&#39;s MCP and API\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENative and bespoke integrations across HubSpot, Mailchimp, AutoSend, Xero, Shopify, accounting platforms, and custom APIs\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMigration from Affinity, Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Microsoft Dynamics, Excel, and CSV-based systems\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESales sequences, call intelligence, and reporting workspace configuration\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOngoing managed support, system enhancements, and roadmap planning\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFractional CTO and digital technology partner engagements for clients who want a senior technology lead without the cost of a full-time hire\u003C\u002Fli\u003E\u003C\u002Ful\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you are ready to move towards a connected, AI-ready operating model, we would love to talk. We offer a complementary 45-60 min strategy session.\u003C\u002Fp\u003E",featured:b,availability:a,numberOfReviews:c,tier:{name:k,imageUrl:p},countryName:bm,npsValue:c,npsSubmissionReceived:c,highlightedTitle:by,highlightedDescription:"Carbon Edge is an Australian technology consultancy helping ambitious businesses transform their operations for an AI-driven world. We have worked with all top-tier CRMs and Attio is the strongest commercial and technical foundation available today. For this reason, Attio sits at the centre of our work as the modern CRM foundation our clients build on, then extend with AI agents, automations, and connected data across their entire stack.We span three modes of engagement: strategic advisory, full delivery, and fractional CTO partnerships. Our work covers CRM and revenue ops, websites and e-commerce, custom applications, workflow automation, and AI integration. Always built as a connected ecosystem rather than a stack of disconnected tools.We work with clients across finance, construction, health, agriculture, e-commerce, professional services, nonprofits and member organisations. Happy to collaborate with in-house teams or other agencies, particularly where modern CRM architecture and AI-powered go-to-market are central to the brief.We offer:Full Attio implementation, including data model design, pipeline architecture, automations, sequences, and reportingAI agent and workflow design using Claude, n8n, and Attio&#39;s MCP and APINative and bespoke integrations across HubSpot, Mailchimp, AutoSend, Xero, Shopify, accounting platforms, and custom APIsMigration from Affinity, Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, Zoho, Microsoft Dynamics, Excel, and CSV-based systemsSales sequences, call intelligence, and reporting workspace configurationOngoing managed support, system enhancements, and roadmap planningFractional CTO and digital technology partner engagements for clients who want a senior technology lead without the cost of a full-time hireIf you are ready to move towards a connected, AI-ready operating model, we would love to talk. We offer a complementary 45-60 min strategy session."}],partnersCanFetchMore:a,partnersInfiniteScrollCount:38,partnersPaginatedCount:c,partnersResultsVisible:a,isPartnersResultsEmpty:b,partnerSkeletons:20,loading:b,infiniteScrollEnabled:a,matchmakingEnabled:a,locationFiltersEnabled:b,locationCountry:d,locationCountryShow:a,locationCountryDisabled:a,locationCountryOptionsLoading:a,locationRegion:d,locationRegionShow:a,locationRegionDisabled:a,locationRegionOptionsLoading:b,locationCity:d,locationCityShow:b,locationCityDisabled:b,locationCityOptionsLoading:b,filtersToDisplay:[{slug:ak,name:al,multiple:a,type:L,display:a,options:[{slug:am,name:an,display:a},{slug:ao,name:t,display:a},{slug:ap,name:u,display:a}]},{slug:aq,name:ar,multiple:a,type:L,display:a,options:[{slug:as,name:B,display:a},{slug:at,name:t,display:a},{slug:au,name:u,display:a}]},{slug:av,name:C,multiple:b,type:L,display:a,options:[{slug:aw,name:ax,display:a},{slug:ay,name:M,display:a},{slug:az,name:N,display:a},{slug:aA,name:O,display:a},{slug:aB,name:P,display:a},{slug:aC,name:Q,display:a},{slug:aD,name:R,display:a},{slug:aE,name:aF,display:a},{slug:aG,name:aH,display:a},{slug:aI,name:S,display:a},{slug:aJ,name:T,display:a},{slug:aK,name:U,display:a}]},{slug:aL,name:aM,multiple:b,type:L,display:a,options:[{slug:aN,name:s,display:a},{slug:aO,name:i,display:a},{slug:aP,name:k,display:a}]}],filtersExpectedNumber:l,filtersLoading:b,filtersSelected:[],paramsToClear:[ba],page:e,pageSize:K,sort:bz,sortingOptions:[{value:bA,label:bB,attribute:bA,sortingOption:"reseller__name"},{value:bC,label:bD,attribute:bC,sortingOption:bE},{value:bz,label:bF,attribute:"tier_review",sortingOption:bG},{value:bH,label:bI,attribute:bH,sortingOption:"-rating"},{value:bJ,label:aQ,attribute:bJ,sortingOption:"-number_of_reviews"}],filtersDefinition:[{id:bK,name:bL,filterOptions:[{id:bM,name:bN,order:c,slug:bO},{id:bP,name:bQ,order:e,slug